//* Device Type:  MIM Capacitor
//* Description:  MIM model 
//* Simulator:    Spectre 
//* Model Version:V101
//* Device  : 1.0 fF/um**2 MIMCAP
//*           1.5 fF/um**2 MIMCAP
//*           2.0 fF/um**2 MIMCAP			
//* Note:  This model is a simplified two-terminal capacitor model for Mixed-Mode application, in 
//* which the parasitic effects such as serias resistance, inductance and substrate coupling 
//* capacitances are not included. 
//*
//********************************************************************************
